  {
   "text": "The Avatar: The Last Airbender Beginner Box is a supplemental Magic set with additional Avatar cards, designed as onboarding experience for beginning players. It is marketed as the best way to learn how to play and includes all essentials for someone's first game of Magic: The Gathering . It was released on November 21, 2025.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "The Beginner Box consists of 10 packets with 20 Avatar: The Last Airbender cards inside each one, with two packets for each of Magic’s five colors of mana (200 cards total). Using the mix-and-match system originally designed for the Jumpstart product line , players can combine and recombine those 10 packets into many different kinds of decks. Beginning players can start with a tutorial game with two pre-shuffled 20-card decks, each with a step-by-step tutorial that will walk them through their first five turns.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each card in the Aang Tutorial and Zuko Tutorial decks is numbered in the bottom-left corner of the card. To properly order the half-deck, put the card numbered \"Aang Tutorial 20\" or \"Zuko Tutorial 20\" at the bottom of the half-deck, followed by \"Aang Tutorial 19\" or \"Zuko Tutorial 19,\" and so on. The card on the top of each half-deck should be \"Aang Tutorial 1\" and \"Zuko Tutorial 1.\"",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Note that the packs and themes in the Beginner Box differ from the Jumpstart packs that can be found in Avatar: The Last Airbender Jumpstart .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "10 Themed Jumpstart half-decks of 20 cards and a theme insert 2 of these are tutorial decks and are designed to be played against each other.",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 \"How to Play\" guides",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 Spindown life counters",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 Reference guide booklet",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "There are 10 different themes.",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Themes"
  },
